{"doc_id":"reg_001","regulation_id":"reg_001","kb_id":"regulation","doc_type":"regulation","title":"殡葬管理条例（示例节选）","article_no":"第十二条","content":"殡葬管理应当节约土地、保护环境。建设殡仪馆、火葬场、公墓等殡葬设施，应当按照规定办理审批手续。禁止在耕地、林地、城市公园、风景名胜区等区域建造坟墓。具体条款以国务院正式发布文本为准。","source_url":"sample://regulation/reg_001","authority":"国务院","effective_date":"2013-01-01","expiry_date":null,"region":"全国","access_level":0,"visible_to_roles":["family","funeral_staff","cemetery_advisor","counselor","account_manager"],"version":"v0","sensitivity":"low","is_sample":true}
{"doc_id":"reg_002","regulation_id":"reg_002","kb_id":"regulation","doc_type":"regulation","title":"跨省遗体运输手续说明（示例）","article_no":"第一条","content":"跨省运输遗体通常需要死亡证明、遗体防腐处理证明、接收地殡仪馆同意接收证明，以及运输车辆和人员资质证明。办理前应向死亡地和接收地民政部门咨询，按要求提交材料。具体手续、时限和材料清单以两地规定为准。","source_url":"sample://regulation/reg_002","authority":"民政部门（示例）","effective_date":"2024-01-01","expiry_date":null,"region":"全国","access_level":0,"visible_to_roles":["family","funeral_staff","cemetery_advisor","counselor","account_manager"],"version":"v0","sensitivity":"low","is_sample":true}
{"doc_id":"reg_003","regulation_id":"reg_003","kb_id":"regulation","doc_type":"regulation","title":"惠民殡葬减免政策（示例）","article_no":"第二条","content":"惠民殡葬政策通常对低保对象、特困人员等困难群体减免基本殡葬服务费用，包括遗体接运、冷藏、火化、骨灰存放等项目。符合条件的家庭可向当地民政部门或殡仪馆提交低保证、特困证明等材料申请。具体减免范围、标准和申请流程以当地政策为准。","source_url":"sample://regulation/reg_003","authority":"民政部门（示例）","effective_date":"2025-01-01","expiry_date":null,"region":"全国","access_level":0,"visible_to_roles":["family","funeral_staff","cemetery_advisor","counselor","account_manager"],"version":"v0","sensitivity":"low","is_sample":true}
{"doc_id":"reg_004","regulation_id":"reg_004","kb_id":"regulation","doc_type":"regulation","title":"公墓安葬与祭扫规定（示例）","article_no":"第三条","content":"公墓安葬应凭死亡证明和火化证明办理墓位手续，禁止建造超标准墓穴。祭扫活动应遵守公墓管理规定，倡导文明祭扫，禁止在禁火区域焚烧祭品。具体规定以当地民政部门和公墓单位公告为准。","source_url":"sample://regulation/reg_004","authority":"民政部门（示例）","effective_date":"2025-03-01","expiry_date":null,"region":"甘肃省","access_level":0,"visible_to_roles":["family","funeral_staff","cemetery_advisor","counselor","account_manager"],"version":"v0","sensitivity":"low","is_sample":true}
